@startuml
title In-process Codex teammate components

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "codex CLI/TUI" {
  component "teammate subcommand" as TeammateCommand
  component "normal TUI" as TUI
  component "sibling Code Mode host" as CodeModeHost
}

package "app-server host" {
  component "ExtensionRegistry" as Registry
  component "ThreadManager" as ThreadManager
}

package "codex-core" {
  component "CodexThread" as CodexThread
  component "InputQueue" as InputQueue
  component "AgentControl" as AgentControl
  component "collaboration handlers" as Handlers
}

package "codex-extension-api" {
  interface "ExternalTeamProvider" as ProviderApi
  component "ExternalTeamHandle" as TeamHandle
}

package "codex-external-team" {
  component "ExternalTeamExtension" as TeamExtension
  component "ClaudeCodeProvider" as ClaudeProvider
  component "DeliveryJournal" as Journal
  component "TaskAdapter" as TaskAdapter
}

package "codex-automation" {
  component "AutomationExtension" as AutomationExtension
  component "SchedulerRuntime" as SchedulerRuntime
  component "Unified-exec monitors" as MonitorRuntime
  database "Durable automation JSON" as AutomationStore
}

TeammateCommand --> TUI : start with external_team config
TUI --> CodexThread : ordinary user input and events
TUI --> CodeModeHost : native Code Mode tools
Registry --> TeamExtension : lifecycle/tool contributors
Registry --> AutomationExtension : lifecycle/tool contributors
Registry --> ThreadManager
ThreadManager --> CodexThread
TeamExtension --> ThreadManager : Weak<ThreadManager>
TeamExtension --> TeamHandle : store in thread data
TeamHandle --> ProviderApi
ClaudeProvider ..|> ProviderApi
TeamExtension --> ClaudeProvider
ClaudeProvider --> Journal
ClaudeProvider --> TaskAdapter

ClaudeProvider --> CodexThread : submit Op::InterAgentCommunication
CodexThread --> InputQueue
Handlers --> TeamHandle : external resolution/delivery
Handlers --> AgentControl : local resolution/delivery

AutomationExtension --> ThreadManager : Weak<ThreadManager>
AutomationExtension --> SchedulerRuntime
SchedulerRuntime --> AutomationStore
SchedulerRuntime --> CodexThread : scheduled InterAgentCommunication
AutomationExtension --> MonitorRuntime
MonitorRuntime --> CodexThread : poll existing unified-exec process
MonitorRuntime --> CodexThread : monitor InterAgentCommunication

note right of TeamExtension
  Dormant unless external_team
  is configured for the thread.
end note

note right of Handlers
  Existing send_message,
  followup_task, list_agents,
  interrupt_agent.
end note

note right of CodeModeHost
  Packaged beside codex and
  required by current models.
end note
@enduml
